# The screen reader (fm1-reader, announce.c), AMB-1's way: a reader listens, and each page, knob value, help card and
# button is said once, in the screen's own words (words.tsv says the short ones in full). A page is said when it
# settles: its name (a voice's page: the voice's too, as its title shows) and its four values; WHERE (or a reader
# that has just started) the whole screen: the page, the header, then what the page shows.
proj template full 0x5EED1234
wait 200
listen
wait 100
said Perform page: Tempo 96, Auto OFF, Form NONE, Ambient OFF. Full ensemble, A NATURAL MINOR, tempo 96, stopped
# (what the page shows follows: the lanes, the horizon, the convergence)
listen
where
said Pluck 1, channel 1, 16 steps, 4 plays left; Pluck 2, channel 2, 15 steps
where
said Horizon: Pluck 1 may mutate, about 4 bars
where
said Convergence 1680 bars, about 4200 seconds. Tension 2. Degree 1
# a page settles before it is said
tap ENV
wait 300
said Voice page, Pluck 1: Channel 1, Loop 16 STEPS, Register G2 to G4, Generator SEED PROCEDURE
# a knob: its name and value, once it settles
spin K1 2
wait 300
said Channel 3
spin K1 -2
wait 300
said Channel 1
# a knob whose value the Mac does not change: shown, nothing said
spin K2 1
wait 300
unsaid Loop
tap FX
wait 300
said Delay page: Feedback 50%, Wet 50%, Ping-pong ON, Filtered ON
where
said Pluck 1 dotted 8th 469 ms, Pluck 2 dotted 8th 469 ms, Bass 8th 313 ms, Pad quarter 625 ms, Lead quarter 625 ms, Heartbeat dotted 8th 469 ms, at 96 BPM
tap GLO
wait 300
said Setup page: Root A, Sync INT, EXT input USB + TRS, Lights ON
where
said Seed 0000 0000 5EED 1234
spin K4 1
wait 300
said Lights KEYS
spin K4 -1
wait 300
tap SEQ
wait 300
said Arranger page: Phase NONE, Length NONE, Bed drop OFF, Reprise OFF
tap ARP
wait 300
said Pattern page, Pluck 1: Ratchet OFF, Steps 16, Generation 1, Plays left 4
spin K1 2
wait 300
said Ratchet 10%
spin K1 -2
wait 300
said Ratchet OFF
tap LFO
wait 300
said CC page, Pluck 1: Target FILTER CC 74, Cycle 16 BARS, Depth 30%, Scene NONE
tap HOME
wait 300
said Perform page
# the panel's messages, said once: PLAY, a mute, a degree
tap PLAY
said PLAYING FULL ENSEMBLE
wait 300
unsaid STOPPED
tapkey 2
said BASS MUTED
tapkey 2
said BASS ON
tapkey w4
said DEGREE 1 NEXT BAR
# HOME + SELECT: the tempo (the Perform page's first value: said as it settles; elsewhere at once, as a message)
press HOME
spin SELECT 2
release HOME
wait 300
said Tempo 98
tap ENV
wait 300
press HOME
spin SELECT -1
release HOME
said TEMPO 97
tap HOME
wait 300
# a help card: its button, then its lines
press FX
wait 1100
said FX button. DELAY TIMES. FOR YOUR EFFECTS AT THE TEMPO
release FX
wait 100
# WHERE while playing: the header says so (the tempo sounding: the new one from the next bar)
wait 2600
where
said Perform page: Tempo 97, Auto OFF, Form NONE, Ambient OFF. Full ensemble, A NATURAL MINOR, tempo 97, playing
tap PLAY
said STOPPED
wait 300
# everything the reader can be told, for the audit (fm1-reader tools/audit.mjs)
speakdump
